{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3zfqgPxx71paEzUt7n","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, old grain weathered silver-grey, iron hinges spotted with rust.*\n\n*A keyhole sits at my center, dark and waiting.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*Tumblers turn — click, click, click — each one a small surrender.*\n\n*I swing inward slowly, hinges groaning a low hymn, revealing:*\n\n**A corridor of warm amber light. The smell of old books and rain-soaked stone. Somewhere deeper, the sound of a single bell, still ringing from a touch that happened long ago.**\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you pass through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":147,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}